 ("A drafting assistant should have which permission?",["Send any email automatically","Delete records for convenience","Save drafts but not send"],2,"Least privilege removes unnecessary capabilities."),
 ("Where should a refund threshold be enforced?",["Only in the prompt","In a tested policy at the execution boundary","In the button colour"],1,"An external technical restriction is more reliable."),
 ("Repeated identical payments after a timeout require...",["Idempotency and deduplication","Longer prompts","A different logo"],0,"Integration controls must prevent duplicate effects."),
